Mr. Whiskers was a black and white mottled catfolk. He used to live on the streets of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/index|Sableclutch]], and was a proud member of the [[Anti-Zorbon Taskforce|Anti-Zorbon Taskforce]], which met in the sewers underneath [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Widdershins/index|Widdershins]].

He was called the head of the taskforce. It was Whiskers who told the Party of a Zorbon meeting to be held beneath the market in Widdershins, and the honey seller [[People/Cora Honeysap|Cora Honeysap]] knew him by that role. When the Party reached the taskforce's hideout in the sewers they found it torn apart, with enough blood for six or seven people and no bodies left behind. Among the belongings left in the room were Whiskers' bundle of things and his folded tinfoil hats, so the Party believes he was one of those killed and taken.

He was slain and used in a necromantic ritual by [[Benjamin Grayson]].
